    "bodyText": "Dear {{greetingName}},\n\nYour order #{{orderId}} has been placed successfully and your payment is confirmed. Your itemised tax invoice is attached as a PDF.\n\nOrder Date: {{orderDate}}\nPayment: {{paymentMethod}} ({{paymentStatus}})\nGrand Total: {{totalDisplay}}",
